.TH GRID_WINDOW 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_window \- The window rectangle on screen: cols*cell_w wide and rows*cell_h tall from x,y, including the trailing gap
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "Rect grid_window(const Grid *g);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The window rectangle on screen: cols*cell_w wide and rows*cell_h tall from x,y, including the trailing gap. Draw a panel behind it, or hit\-test it to see whether the mouse is over the grid at all.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_cell_rect (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
